List-Id: linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org

This patch series adds support for the Marvell's Dove SoC (88AP510).

The following interfaces/features are enabled by this series:
 CPU in ARMv6 mode
 L2 Cache
 Uart
 Giga Ethernet
 SPI
 RTC
 XOR dma engines
 PCIE
 USB
 SATA
 I2C
 GPIO

 
